  keywords="co-pack assembly Singapore, co-packing services Singapore, contract packaging Singapore FMCG, GWP co-pack Singapore, promotional co-pack assembly, on-pack promotion assembly Singapore, shrink bundle pack Singapore, co-packing company Singapore"
